Third-party sounds:
Instrument sounds are loaded at runtime from the FluidR3_GM soundfont,
licensed under CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/),
as pre-rendered by the midi-js-soundfonts project
(https://github.com/gleitz/midi-js-soundfonts). They are not included in
this repository and are not covered by the license above.
